            <note corresp="#d306-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d306-f1-content">
                <p>The gist of this message was included in telegram No. 11 of July 10 from
                        Grew to Byrnes (file No. 740.00119 Potsdam/7–1045).</p>
